   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Action you place by hand\n\nNo audio needed: mark where the action should land. Each red marker on the timeline becomes a hit sound in that shot's guide, so the action lands there.\n\n- **Timeline**: double-click to add a hit, drag to move it, right-click to delete it. **duration** sets the length.\n- **hit_sound**: thump (punches, blows), crash (cymbals), boom (thunder, explosions).\n- The finished video carries the hit sounds; swap in your own mix afterwards.\n\n**This version: hits that land.** Full model, 30 steps, CFG 5 with the negative zeroed before the guide, so the picture is pushed onto the audio.\n\nNodes: Syntax Timeline and the optional Syntax Preview Strip (the sync bar along the bottom; delete it to hide); everything else is core."
   ]
  },
